{"kind":"html","caption":"用栈保存尚未闭合的左括号；遇到右括号时，只能与栈顶的左括号配对，因为后出现的左括号必须先闭合。动画对比示例 “([])” 和 “([)]”：前者每次都与栈顶匹配并最终清空，后者读到 “)” 时栈顶仍是 “[”，因此立即判定无效。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>有效的括号可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.example-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-bottom:6px}\n.tab{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;background:#2d2d30}\n.tab.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.chars{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;min-height:48px;margin-bottom:6px}\n.char .symbol{font-size:14px}\n.char.done{border-color:#467a46}\n.char.bad{background:#6b2929;border-color:#f14c4c}\n.message{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n.message.bad{border-left-color:#f14c4c}\n.stack{display:flex;flex-direction:column-reverse;gap:4px;min-height:100px;padding:8px;border:1px dashed #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#1c1c1c}\n.stack-item{padding:6px 8px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.stack-item.top::after{content:\"栈顶\";display:block;font-size:10px;color:#fff;margin-top:2px}\n.result-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px}\n.result-label{color:#8d8d8d}\n.result-value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff;font-size:13px}\n.result-value.false{color:#f14c4c}\n.progress-bar{height:3px;background:#3794ff;border-radius:2px;transition:width .35s;flex:1;min-width:80px}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>栈顶决定能否闭合</h1>\n<div class=\"rule\" style=\"margin-top:0\">左括号入栈；右括号须匹配栈顶并弹栈。</div>\n<div class=\"example-tabs\"><div class=\"tab\" id=\"tab0\">示例 4 <span class=\"mono\">([])</span></div><div class=\"tab\" id=\"tab1\">示例 5 <span class=\"mono\">([)]</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">扫描</div><div class=\"chars\" id=\"chars\"></div><div class=\"message\" id=\"message\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">栈</div><div class=\"stack\" id=\"stack\"></div></section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"result-row\"><span class=\"result-label\">结论</span><span class=\"result-value\" id=\"result\">检查中…</span><div class=\"progress\" style=\"flex:1;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px\"><div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"progress\"></div></div></div>\n</main>\n<script>\n\n  const cases = [\n    {\n      text: \"([])\",\n      frames: [\n        { i: 0, stack: [\"(\"], msg: \"读到左括号 (，压入栈。\" },\n        { i: 1, stack: [\"(\", \"[\"], msg: \"读到左括号 [，压入栈；它现在位于栈顶。\" },\n        { i: 2, stack: [\"(\"], msg: \"读到 ]，与栈顶 [ 类型相同，配对成功并弹栈。\" },\n        { i: 3, stack: [], msg: \"读到 )，与栈顶 ( 配对成功；扫描结束时栈为空。\", result: \"true\" }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      text: \"([)]\",\n      frames: [\n        { i: 0, stack: [\"(\"], msg: \"读到左括号 (，压入栈。\" },\n        { i: 1, stack: [\"(\", \"[\"], msg: \"读到左括号 [，压入栈；后出现的 [ 必须先闭合。\" },\n        { i: 2, stack: [\"(\", \"[\"], msg: \"读到 )，但栈顶是 [：类型不匹配，不能越过 [ 去寻找 (。\", bad: true, result: \"false\" }\n      ]\n    }\n  ];\n  const charsEl = document.getElementById(\"chars\");\n  const stackEl = document.getElementById(\"stack\");\n  const messageEl = document.getElementById(\"message\");\n  const resultEl = document.getElementById(\"result\");\n  const progressEl = document.getElementById(\"progress\");\n  let caseIndex = 0;\n  let frameIndex = 0;\n\n  function render() {\n    const item = cases[caseIndex];\n    const frame = item.frames[frameIndex];\n    document.getElementById(\"tab0\").classList.toggle(\"active\", caseIndex === 0);\n    document.getElementById(\"tab1\").classList.toggle(\"active\", caseIndex === 1);\n\n    charsEl.innerHTML = \"\";\n    [...item.text].forEach((symbol, index) => {\n      const cell = document.createElement(\"div\");\n      cell.className = \"char\";\n      if (index < frame.i) cell.classList.add(\"done\");\n      if (index === frame.i) cell.classList.add(frame.bad ? \"bad\" : \"active\");\n      cell.innerHTML = '<span class=\"symbol\">' + symbol + '</span><span class=\"index\">下标 ' + index + '</span>';\n      charsEl.appendChild(cell);\n    });\n\n    stackEl.innerHTML = \"\";\n    if (frame.stack.length === 0) {\n      stackEl.innerHTML = '<div class=\"empty\">栈为空</div>';\n    } else {\n      frame.stack.forEach((symbol, index) => {\n        const node = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        node.className = \"stack-item\" + (index === frame.stack.length - 1 ? \" top\" : \"\");\n        node.textContent = symbol;\n        stackEl.appendChild(node);\n      });\n    }\n\n    messageEl.textContent = frame.msg;\n    messageEl.classList.toggle(\"bad\", !!frame.bad);\n    resultEl.textContent = frame.result || \"检查中…\";\n    resultEl.className = \"result-value\" + (frame.result === \"false\" ? \" false\" : \"\");\n    progressEl.style.width = ((frameIndex + 1) / item.frames.length * 100) + \"%\";\n  }\n\n  function advance() {\n    const frames = cases[caseIndex].frames;\n    if (frameIndex < frames.length - 1) {\n      frameIndex += 1;\n    } else {\n      caseIndex = (caseIndex + 1) % cases.length;\n      frameIndex = 0;\n    }\n    render();\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(advance, 1900);\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":"","time_complexity":"O(n)","space_complexity":"O(n)","complexity_note":"n 为字符串长度. 每个括号至多入栈、出栈一次, 最坏需要保存 n 个尚未闭合的左括号."}
